---
// Componente Hero para la clínica veterinaria
---

<section class="relative min-h-[calc(100vh-4.5rem)] flex flex-col justify-center overflow-hidden bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20 transition-colors duration-200">
  <!-- Adorno de fondo difuminado -->
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 right-0 -z-10 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-teal-200/40 dark:bg-teal-900/20 blur-3xl"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-24 -left-24 -z-10 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-amber-100/40 dark:bg-amber-950/20 blur-3xl"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8">
      <!-- Columna de texto principal -->
      <div class="text-center lg:col-span-7 lg:text-left">
        <!-- Badge superior de urgencias -->
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-teal-200 bg-teal-100/80 dark:border-teal-800/60 dark:bg-teal-950/70 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-teal-900 dark:text-teal-300 shadow-xs">
          <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
            <span class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-teal-400 opacity-75"></span>
            <span class="relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-teal-600 dark:bg-teal-400"></span>
          </span>
          Urgencias Veterinarias 24 Horas · Los 365 días del año
        </div>

        <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
          El cuidado y amor que tu mascota{' '}
          <span class="text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400">realmente merece</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 sm:text-xl">
          Somos más que una clínica: somos la segunda familia de tu peludo. Medicina preventiva de
          excelencia, especialistas dedicados y tecnología diagnóstica en un ambiente libre de
          estrés.
        </p>

        <!-- Botones de Acción (CTA) -->
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center lg:justify-start">
          <a
            href="/agendar"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-teal-600 px-6 py-3.5 text-base font-bold text-white shadow-md transition hover:bg-teal-700 hover:shadow-lg focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-teal-600 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 active:scale-98"
          >
            Agendar Consulta Médica
            <svg
              class="ml-2 h-5 w-5"
              fill="none"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              stroke="currentColor"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"
              />
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a
            href="#servicios"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 px-6 py-3.5 text-base font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 shadow-xs transition hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-teal-600 focus-visible:outline-offset-2"
          >
            Explorar Servicios
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Indicador de confianza rápido en píldoras limpias (sin línea cortada) -->
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2.5 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 lg:justify-start">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-slate-200/80 bg-white/70 px-3 py-1.5 shadow-2xs backdrop-blur-xs dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/60">
            <svg
              class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"
              />
            </svg>
            <span class="font-medium">Veterinarios Colegiados</span>
          </div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-slate-200/80 bg-white/70 px-3 py-1.5 shadow-2xs backdrop-blur-xs dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/60">
            <svg
              class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"
              />
            </svg>
            <span class="font-medium">Manejo Libre de Estrés (Fear Free)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-slate-200/80 bg-white/70 px-3 py-1.5 shadow-2xs backdrop-blur-xs dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/60">
            <svg
              class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"
              />
            </svg>
            <span class="font-medium">Pabellón de Alta Complejidad</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Columna derecha: Tarjeta visual destacada y métricas -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-md rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-6 shadow-xl lg:max-w-none transition-colors duration-200">
          <!-- Banner ilustrativo de la clínica -->
          <div class="flex h-52 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-500 to-teal-700 dark:from-teal-600 dark:to-teal-800 p-6 text-center text-white shadow-inner">
            <div class="flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-white/15 backdrop-blur-xs">
              <svg
                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                class="h-10 w-10 text-white"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="currentColor"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <circle cx="12" cy="15" r="4" />
                <circle cx="6.5" cy="11.5" r="2" />
                <circle cx="10" cy="7.5" r="2" />
                <circle cx="14" cy="7.5" r="2" />
                <circle cx="17.5" cy="11.5" r="2" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h2 class="mt-4 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Clínica Veterinaria Huellitas</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-teal-100">Compromiso médico, vocación y amor animal</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Métricas de impacto -->
          <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/80 pt-6">
            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 p-4 text-center transition">
              <p class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400">+5.000</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
                Pacientes Atendidos
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 p-4 text-center transition">
              <p class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400">12+</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
                Años de Trayectoria
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 p-4 text-center transition">
              <p class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-amber-500">4.9 ★</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
                +850 Reseñas Google
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 p-4 text-center transition">
              <p class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400">24/7</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
                Urgencias Médicas
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
